# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SMARTAPPLY TUNISIA — EXEMPLE DE CONFIGURATION .env.example
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Chaîne de connexion MongoDB Atlas Cloud
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@<cluster>.mongodb.net/smartapply?retryWrites=true&w=majority

# Clé secrète pour la signature JWT (Access Tokens)
JWT_SECRET=votre_cle_secrete_jwt_robuste_au_moins_32_caracteres_2026

# Google reCAPTCHA v3
# Clé de site (Site Key) visible côté client
NEXT_PUBLIC_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=your_recaptcha_v3_site_key

# Clé secrète (Secret Key) pour l'API Google siteverify
RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=your_recaptcha_v3_secret_key

# Seuil de score reCAPTCHA v3 (défaut : 0.5)
RECAPTCHA_SCORE_THRESHOLD=0.5

# URL racine du site
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Deployment: same Mongo database and JWT secret on frontend/backend
MONGODB_DB=smartapply
CV_MODULE_BACKEND_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com
POSTS_REALTIME_SECRET=replace_with_random_shared_secret
# Optional verified Google OAuth (test chooser only works in development)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret
